<title>USA: Conseco completes securities offering.</title>
<headline>Conseco completes securities offering.</headline>
<dateline>CARMEL, Ind. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conseco Inc said Wednesday it completed a public offering of 325,000 of the 8.7 percent capital trust pass-through securities.</p>
<p>Each of the Financing Trust II securities will pay cumulative cash dividends at an annual rate of 8.7 percent of the stated $1,000 liquidation amount per security, payable semi-annually starting May 15, 1997.</p>
<p>Proceeds of about $321.3 million will be used to repay debt.</p>
<p>Conseco is a financial services company.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
